headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{BEARER_TOKEN}}
}

docs {
  PulseFitness.ai <> Sicon Service WebAPI v1.
  Company: Pulse Fitness = companyId 2 (set in the environment).
  READ-FIRST: ALLOW_WRITES defaults to false; POST/PUT refuse to run until it is true.
  Milestone 1 (read-only): Auth -> Lookups -> Equipment/GetMany (paginate) -> map -> store siconEquipmentId.
  Runtime ids (caseId, appointmentId, equipmentId, trackingNoteId, timeBookingId) are CAPTURED
  from responses via each request's post-response script (bru.setVar) and are NOT reset to 0.
  See mapping.csv and FIELD_MAPPING.md bundled at the collection root.
}
